    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、だけど、\r\n２件とも同日の仕事でな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あ～……\r\nそうなんだ、なんか残念だね～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ピンポイントにふたつが被るの、\r\n逆にすごいけど～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………\r\n──それで、だ",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "両方とも、まだ返事をしていない\r\nどちらか一方を受けようと思う",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "うん～\r\nそうするしかないもんね～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
