  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "随分決めるのが早いけど\r\n…………両方、よく読んだか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "うん～！　読んだよ～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "どっちもやれるなら、どっちもやりたいけど\r\n……どっちかしか選べないんでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "それなら雛菜、こっちの\r\nユアクマちゃんカフェのお仕事がいい",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……雛菜、好きだもんなこのキャラクター",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもこっちの仕事だって\r\n雛菜にとって魅力的だと思うんだ、例えば──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………\r\nプロデューサーは、そっちの方を受けて欲しいの～？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "それなら、最初から\r\nそうやって相談してくれたらいいのに",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや、違うんだ\r\nそういう訳じゃなくて……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "余りにも即決で……迷いがないからさ\r\nどっちも同じくらい魅力的だって言いたくて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……だけどどっちか\r\nひとつしか選べないんでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうなんだ\r\nだからこそ、よく考えてほしくて──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "いっぱい時間をかければ、\r\nちゃんと考えたってことになるの？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……だから雛菜は、\r\nちゃんと考えてないだろ～ってこと？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "008",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\nいや、そうじゃないんだ……すまん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺自身、すごく決め難くてさ\r\nどちらがいいとも言い切れなかった",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雛菜がすぐに答えを出したから\r\nあとで後悔しないか心配になって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それが結果的に、雛菜が考えてない\r\nみたいな言い方になったかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～……\r\nそれはいいけど",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020210,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ちゃんと考えて選んだから\r\n明日になったとしても、雛菜は変わらないよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020220,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜がすっごくしあわせ～って\r\n思える方を選ぶんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300502/2023005020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023005020230,
